          <attvalue for="4" value="Prosecutors used ChatGPT logs as evidence in the Palisades fire trial Prosecutors turned to location data from his iPhone, security camera footage, and witness testimony - and they also turned to his ChatGPT logs. They pointed to a screen recording in which Rinderknecht asked ChatGPT whether someone could be blamed for a fire if it was lit by their cigarette. #JonathanRinderknecht #PalisadesFire #openai #chatgpt #legal #artificialintelligence #ai #technology #tech https://www.theverge.com/ai-ar…" />
