          <attvalue for="4" value="Displaced by the Eaton or Palisades wildfires? The Los Angeles County Registrar-Recorder/County Clerk is ready to help. You have options for the upcoming Statewide Primary Election. Your ballot can reach you wherever you're staying, and you can still vote in your home district. Add a temporary mailing address to your registration to ensure you receive your Vote by Mail ballot. #Vote #EatonFire #PalisadesFire https://www.lavote.gov/recovery" />
