          <attvalue for="3" value="en" />
          <attvalue for="4" value="Oh man... I was just getting caught up on #Shrinking on #AppleTV (which is excellent) and I saw in the cast biographies that Jason Segel was born in Pacific Palisades. 😳 He was a frequent performer at the Palisades Playhouse while in school. It seems that theatre has completely burned down in the #PalisadesWildfire. I feel so bad for all the cultural history lost along with the architecture. Thoughts to all the theatre kids, teachers, and the community who lost a place they loved. #LAStrong" />
