      <node id="115792245768975666" label="@sadele2: The #Palisadian-Post Prints Its Last Edition. Its final online issue…">
        <attvalues>
          <attvalue for="0" value="109258025387991967" />
          <attvalue for="1" value="sadele2" />
          <attvalue for="2" value="2025-12-27T15:30:53.277Z" />
          <attvalue for="3" value="en" />
          <attvalue for="4" value="The #Palisadian-Post Prints Its Last Edition. Its final online issue is up now. The Palisadian-Post was published for 97 years, but the twice-monthly community #newspaper couldn’t survive the Los Angeles &quot;wildfires. &quot;…Alan Smolinisky, the owner of the paper, said that the #Palisades became a “ghost town” after the fire, bringing readership effectively down to zero.&quot; “We lost the one thing we can’t do without — our readers,” he wrote. #PalisadesFire 🎁 https://www.nytimes.com/2025/12/14/us/califo…" />
          <attvalue for="5" value="palisadian|newspaper|palisades|palisadesfire" />
