          <attvalue for="4" value="📌 Deadline extended Via LA County CJIC: Impacted LA County residents now have until April 15, 2025 to submit a Right of Entry form to opt-in to the government-run debris removal program or opt-out. The scope of the debris removal program is also expanding beyond only residential property owners to include condominiums and multi-family buildings that have at least ONE unit that is occupied by the owner. For more info: https://www.gov.ca.gov/2025/03/28/federal-government-approves-californias-requ…" />
