          <attvalue for="3" value="en" />
          <attvalue for="4" value="Here’s something we can do to revive craft machine manufacturing: socialize custom firefighting equipment building. Firefighters certainly must require equipment unique to their home terrains. And with more extreme climate conditions, adaptable and mobile equipment is also necessary. It’s time to reject capitalist obsession with the Henry Ford model. I know about an ideal factory site in Seattle area. #firetrucks #palisadesfire #backlog #privateequity https://www.nytimes.com/2025/02/17/us/fire-…" />
