          <attvalue for="3" value="en" />
          <attvalue for="4" value="Eligible households can receive up to $18,000 based on household size and composition. The relief fund will distribute $32.2 million in financial assistance to wildfire survivors for housing costs, living expenses and funeral costs. Priority will be given to the most impacted households based on need, including insurance status, social and economic vulnerability, loss of life, health conditions, and other risk factors. 2/2 #EatonFire #PalisadesFire #Relief" />
