          <attvalue for="3" value="en" />
          <attvalue for="4" value="5am on Thursday looks to be about when things might get a bit concerning for the #PalisadesFire and #EatonFire burn scars. Wind blowing the storm from the south into Malibu/Pacific Palisades tends to be favorable for orographic enhancement (ie more rain). Check for more details from the local NWS office, if it still exists Thursday 😬" />
