          <attvalue for="3" value="en" />
          <attvalue for="4" value="So a bunch of trails in the Palisades Fire burn area were burned terribly. A lot of trail maintenance will need to be done due to fire lines, dozer lines, downed trees etc. hopefully starting in February. “ On Saddle Peak Trail, the dozers went through about 20 switchbacks, right down the middle. These will be particularly difficult, and take a great deal of work, to restore.” The Santa Monica Mountains Task Force www.smmtf.org has a nice write up on it. And an attached LA Times article as well…" />
