          <attvalue for="3" value="en" />
          <attvalue for="4" value="(continued) #EatonFire #PalisadesFire #cybersecurity Best Practices • Enable multi-factor authentication (MFA) for email and user accounts wherever possible. • Do not click on links contained in any email or text related to the Southern California wildfires. Instead, manually visit the organization’s website. • Watchout for misspelled URLs or unusual domain extensions. Anything other than “.com”, “.net”, “.org”, or “.gov” would be suspicious and likely malicious. • Ensure the website you are vi…" />
