          <attvalue for="3" value="en" />
          <attvalue for="4" value="@jeridansky @ai6yr Pretty sure the remediators use the sealed Tyvek suits - taped joints and all of that is stripped off and goes into bags... and then they go into contamination showers... So all of us &quot;normal folks&quot; would not have that type of system... Additionally - if your own house is not well sealed - and houses with those bad things are burning around you --- your house could be contaminated. Yourself, your vehicles, etc. --- There is nothing good coming out of those fires." />
