      <node id="113959156976840548" label="@ikluft@avgeek.social: The most dangerous moment in my #Australia trip was due to #weather t…">
        <attvalues>
          <attvalue for="0" value="109525810222134461" />
          <attvalue for="1" value="ikluft@avgeek.social" />
          <attvalue for="2" value="2025-02-06T21:52:09.000Z" />
          <attvalue for="3" value="en" />
          <attvalue for="4" value="The most dangerous moment in my #Australia trip was due to #weather that could happen anywhere, not due to wildlife🐨🦘🐍. On a walk in a park with lakes in Melbourne, I heard distant thunder &amp; saw sporadic large raindrops. Thunderstorms to the west were moving in. I started back to my friend's place. Almost there, I heard loud buzzing sound from a metal residential fence. I recognized it as St Elmo's Fire, a potential imminent lightning🌩️ strike there. I ran and got indoors. https://en.wikipedia.…" />
          <attvalue for="5" value="australia|weather" />
          <attvalue for="6" value="context_descendants" />
          <attvalue for="7" value="1" />
          <attvalue for="8" value="2" />
