          <attvalue for="3" value="en" />
          <attvalue for="4" value="As much as tourists in #Australia would like to see them, it's hard to find a Koala🐨 in the wild. Fortunately @Leighton spotted this one. And I got a picture. This was on Feb 1 at the Tower Hill volcano and surrounding wildlife reserve in southwest Victoria. #travel #photography" />
