          <attvalue for="3" value="en" />
          <attvalue for="4" value="My #Australia trip started in Sydney. On the way out of town on January 27, @Leighton and I stopped at a viewing point for #SYD / #YSSY Airport's runways. Pictured here: Singapore 777-300ER, Qantas 787-9 in special Aboriginal art livery, 2 Qantas 737-800NGs, Malaysian A330-300. #aviation #travel #avgeek #photography" />
