          <attvalue for="2" value="2025-02-18T20:40:04.000Z" />
          <attvalue for="3" value="en" />
          <attvalue for="4" value="4 weeks ago my adventure to #Australia began. I've been back almost 2 weeks now. It was a fun and memorable trip. I had my first flights on an A380 outbound and 787 on the return trip, both of which can mostly only be found on the longest international flights such as this. I visited New South Wales, Australian Capital Territory, Victoria and South Australia, including Sydney, Canberra and Melbourne. https://avgeek.social/@ikluft/113868608754632970 #aviation #travel #avgeek" />
          <attvalue for="5" value="australia|aviation|travel|avgeek" />
