      <node id="114038404389523746" label="@ikluft@avgeek.social: During my trip to Australia, I switched my devices and apps to show m…">
        <attvalues>
          <attvalue for="0" value="109525810222134461" />
          <attvalue for="1" value="ikluft@avgeek.social" />
          <attvalue for="2" value="2025-02-20T21:45:49.000Z" />
          <attvalue for="3" value="en" />
          <attvalue for="4" value="During my trip to Australia, I switched my devices and apps to show metric units (Celsius, km, etc). Get the whole experience, right? I don't mind since I can convert most common imperial⇔metric units in my head anyway. That's except for temperature since °F &amp; °C don't have the same zero - I often use a converter app for that. After I returned home, it took almost a week to find all those settings and change them back. 😀" />
          <attvalue for="5" value="" />
