      <node id="114159739662898080" label="@ikluft@avgeek.social: I'll post another mention of the video I made from my #Australia trip…">
        <attvalues>
          <attvalue for="0" value="109525810222134461" />
          <attvalue for="1" value="ikluft@avgeek.social" />
          <attvalue for="2" value="2025-03-14T08:02:59.000Z" />
          <attvalue for="3" value="en" />
          <attvalue for="4" value="I'll post another mention of the video I made from my #Australia trip. I noticed once the analytics were collected that YouTube's &quot;algorithm&quot; only promoted it in Australia. 🤦 Though it got 3000 views there. (Yay mates! Thx!) Let's get the word out that the fun pictures people liked earlier in this thread came together into an #avgeek #travel story about lots of fun places to see there. https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=6BZrHoR4Dv8 #aviation" />
