      <node id="114214785028868910" label="@ikluft@avgeek.social: A fun moment on my Australia trip (late Jan-early Feb) on the A380 tr…">
        <attvalues>
          <attvalue for="0" value="109525810222134461" />
          <attvalue for="1" value="ikluft@avgeek.social" />
          <attvalue for="2" value="2025-03-24T01:21:46.000Z" />
          <attvalue for="3" value="en" />
          <attvalue for="4" value="A fun moment on my Australia trip (late Jan-early Feb) on the A380 transpacific flight from Los Angeles to Sydney... I watched episode 1 of Strange Planet titled &quot;The Flying Machine&quot; while in flight over the Pacific. In perfect but unplanned timing, during the scene where bad turbulence hit with screaming, we also got turbulence for real on my flight at that moment. However, ours was just normal light chop, no screaming. Had to laugh! https://www.imdb.com/title/tt19383028/ #aviation #avgeek #tr…" />
