      <node id="114218721263653989" label="@ikluft@avgeek.social: Another sign the seasons are changing... Right now it's the first tim…">
        <attvalues>
          <attvalue for="0" value="109525810222134461" />
          <attvalue for="1" value="ikluft@avgeek.social" />
          <attvalue for="2" value="2025-03-24T18:02:54.000Z" />
          <attvalue for="3" value="en" />
          <attvalue for="4" value="Another sign the seasons are changing... Right now it's the first time since my Jan/Feb Australia trip and some weeks of planning before it that I've seen a higher temperature in Portland, Oregon🇺🇸 than Melbourne, Victoria🇦🇺. In early February when I was sightseeing in Melbourne, the southern hemisphere summer heat was 100F/38C while a lookup showed Portland was just above freezing. Of course it's before sunrise in Melbourne. But Portland's high tomorrow is forecast to be higher. #travel #weath…" />
          <attvalue for="5" value="travel|weather" />
          <attvalue for="6" value="context_descendants" />
