      <node id="114231121672118733" label="@ikluft@avgeek.social: This was a limited hint of Summer in early Spring. Actually PDX Airpo…">
        <attvalues>
          <attvalue for="0" value="109525810222134461" />
          <attvalue for="1" value="ikluft@avgeek.social" />
          <attvalue for="2" value="2025-03-26T22:36:29.000Z" />
          <attvalue for="3" value="en" />
          <attvalue for="4" value="This was a limited hint of Summer in early Spring. Actually PDX Airport was reporting 81F/27C and suddenly dropped to 77F/25C. (This is showing a nearby reporting point.) Since yesterday at 80F/26.6C tied the all-time record for any day in March in Portland, we can expect NWS to confirm a new all-time record was set today. As thunderstorms herald an incoming cold front, Melbourne will have warmer temperatures again for at least the next week. But the seasons are changing. #travel #weather" />
          <attvalue for="5" value="travel|weather" />
          <attvalue for="6" value="context_descendants" />
