          <attvalue for="3" value="en" />
          <attvalue for="4" value="Let me add a link at the end of the thread from my January/February 2025 trip to Australia... The deal that fellow #avgeek and #pilot @Leighton and I made was to each act as guide for a #roadtrip visiting the other's country. I did return the favor - here's the link to the thread with pictures from Leighton's trip to the USA in June/July 2025. Each trip was in the other's summer. Neither of us had to drive on the other country's &quot;wrong side of the road&quot;. https://avgeek.social/@ikluft/1147397363…" />
