      <node id="115862104869132956" label="@patrickokeefe: Southern California is still recovering. The response from Trump - an…">
        <attvalues>
          <attvalue for="0" value="109237602809603384" />
          <attvalue for="1" value="patrickokeefe" />
          <attvalue for="2" value="2026-01-08T23:36:58.531Z" />
          <attvalue for="3" value="en" />
          <attvalue for="4" value="Southern California is still recovering. The response from Trump - and, by extension, those who support him - has been cruel. After promising to provide the disaster relief funding needed, the vast majority of it has been withheld. The funding has further been conditioned on disenfranchising voters or imaginary water spigots that supposedly could have prevented this tragedy." />
          <attvalue for="5" value="" />
          <attvalue for="6" value="context_descendants" />
          <attvalue for="7" value="1" />
          <attvalue for="8" value="0" />
          <attvalue for="9" value="0" />
          <attvalue for="10" value="1" />
          <attvalue for="11" value="0" />
          <attvalue for="12" value="2" />
          <attvalue for="13" value="1" />
          <attvalue for="14" value="1" />
        </attvalues>
      </node>
      <node id="115862105355011511" label="@patrickokeefe: The cruelty deepened, of course, because Trump and his supporters app…">
        <attvalues>
          <attvalue for="0" value="109237602809603384" />
          <attvalue for="1" value="patrickokeefe" />
          <attvalue for="2" value="2026-01-08T23:37:05.946Z" />
          <attvalue for="3" value="en" />
          <attvalue for="4" value="The cruelty deepened, of course, because Trump and his supporters apparently saw red in that moment of weakness, and have attempted to deliver blow-after-blow to California in the year that followed. The disaster relief funding was a drop in the bucket of the federal funding that has been withheld from us, or threatened to be withheld, by this administration." />
          <attvalue for="5" value="" />
          <attvalue for="6" value="context_descendants" />
          <attvalue for="7" value="1" />
          <attvalue for="8" value="0" />
          <attvalue for="9" value="0" />
          <attvalue for="10" value="1" />
          <attvalue for="11" value="0" />
          <attvalue for="12" value="2" />
          <attvalue for="13" value="1" />
          <attvalue for="14" value="1" />
        </attvalues>
      </node>
      <node id="115862105642630533" label="@patrickokeefe: We shouldn't receive education and research funding unless we scare t…">
        <attvalues>
          <attvalue for="0" value="109237602809603384" />
          <attvalue for="1" value="patrickokeefe" />
          <attvalue for="2" value="2026-01-08T23:37:10.336Z" />
          <attvalue for="3" value="en" />
          <attvalue for="4" value="We shouldn't receive education and research funding unless we scare trans people. We shouldn't receive child care funding because of &quot;fraud&quot; that miraculously only exists in states that talk back to Trump. The military should be deployed in our cities unless we scare undocumented immigrants. An estimated 3.4 million Californians (roughly the population of Arkansas) are expected to lose healthcare coverage because of Medicaid cuts. And on and on." />
          <attvalue for="5" value="" />
          <attvalue for="6" value="context_descendants" />
          <attvalue for="7" value="1" />
          <attvalue for="8" value="0" />
          <attvalue for="9" value="0" />
          <attvalue for="10" value="1" />
          <attvalue for="11" value="0" />
          <attvalue for="12" value="2" />
          <attvalue for="13" value="1" />
          <attvalue for="14" value="1" />
        </attvalues>
      </node>
      <node id="115862105824472189" label="@patrickokeefe: The message from Trump and his supporters is along the lines of, &quot;in…">
        <attvalues>
          <attvalue for="0" value="109237602809603384" />
          <attvalue for="1" value="patrickokeefe" />
          <attvalue for="2" value="2026-01-08T23:37:13.111Z" />
          <attvalue for="3" value="en" />
          <attvalue for="4" value="The message from Trump and his supporters is along the lines of, &quot;in your darkest hour, we'll help you if you become us.&quot; But that's not support at all, and it's not American. This era will end - I hope - but the cruelty will not be forgotten." />
