          <attvalue for="2" value="2025-10-13T22:18:26.000Z" />
          <attvalue for="3" value="en" />
          <attvalue for="4" value="@OLjohnel @camless In LA County near Altadena, there's historical streambeds and also street drainage maps, and they reflect where the flooding was the last time (and also, historically). That whole town is built on an alluvial fan!" />
